ry Button-module-scss-module__1SItCG__size-main text-body-2" data-cta-position="newsletterDeveloper" data-cta-url="/pricing#api">See pricing</a><a href="/contact-sales" class="Button-module-scss-module__1SItCG__button Button-module-scss-module__1SItCG__variant-secondary Button-module-scss-module__1SItCG__size-main text-body-2" data-cta-position="newsletterDeveloper" data-cta-url="/contact-sales">Contact sales</a></div></div><div class="NewsletterDeveloper-module-scss-module__QNWQga__card"><div class="Illustration-module-scss-module__pBGuRG__base Illustration-module-scss-module__pBGuRG__pictogram Illustration-module-scss-module__pBGuRG__size-medium" role="img" aria-label="Beige and dark illustrated mailbox with a tilted top lid and vertical mail slot. Simple geometric design in muted colors."></div><h3 class="Heading-module-scss-module__AyGdUq__heading text-headline-5-serif Heading-module-scss-module__AyGdUq__balance">Get the developer newsletter</h3><p class="NewsletterDeveloper-module-scss-module__QNWQga__cardBody text-body-2">Product updates, how-tos, community spotlights, and more. Delivered monthly to your inbox.</p><form class="TextInput-module-scss-module__9-ItLa__form"><div class="text-body-3 TextInput-module-scss-module__9-ItLa__inputWrapper TextInput-module-scss-module__9-ItLa__newsletter"><input type="email" placeholder="Enter your email" required="" autoComplete="email" class="TextInput-module-scss-module__9-ItLa__input" aria-label="Email address" aria-required="true" value=""/><button class="Button-module-scss-module__1SItCG__button Button-module-scss-module__1SItCG__variant-primary Button-module-scss-module__1SItCG__size-iconMain Button-module-scss-module__1SItCG__iconOnly text-body-3 TextInput-module-scss-module__9-ItLa__newsletterSubmit" type="submit" aria-label="Subscribe"><span class="Button-module-scss-module__1SItCG__icon"><div class="_base-module-scss-module__SsgDWW__wrapper" style="width:16px;height:16px"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0