so there's no fixed message count. Free covers everyday questions. Pro gives you at least 5x more usage per 5-hour session than Free. Max gives you 5x or 20x more usage per 5-hour session than Pro. On Team plans, Standard seats give more than Pro and Premium seats give 5x more than Standard. To manage capacity and make sure all users have fair access, we may limit your usage in other ways, such as weekly and monthly caps or model and feature usage, at our discretion. When you reach a limit, you can wait for it to reset, move to a higher plan, or, on paid plans, turn on \u003cb\u003eusage credits\u003c/b\u003e to keep working at standard API rates. You can see where you stand anytime in \u003cc\u003eSettings \u003e Usage\u003c/c\u003e.3:[\"$\",\"$L12\",null,{\"value\":\"en\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L13\",null,{\"locale\":\"en\",\"messages\":{\"+4BcOVAjaQ\":\"Media \u0026 entertainment\",\"+58+bO9Z7C\":\"Claude Design, Slides, and Docs\",\"+ECAI6c+vi\":\"See more\",\"+Hz2eiXVaS\":\"Additional hours\",\"+IWy/mZgxa\":\"Read 5 pricing pages\",\"+QVISEnK30\":\"Read 214 replies in [survey], Jul 27 – Aug 25\",\"+U6ozcnv4r\":\"Type\",\"+UZzShz4Ps\":\"Financial Services \u0026 Insurance\",\"+WOEzJDN46\":\"Enterprise search across your organization\",\"+ciZoNegZ/"])</script><script nonce="usfoTvutOV5VRcTEPvHMSQ==">self.__next_f.push([1,"\":\"Product updates, how-tos, community spotlights, and more. Delivered monthly to your inbox.\",\"+fSZ8QbnO+\":\"Customer Support \u0026 Service Operations\",\"+ftV4Gx834\":\"Try Claude Code\",\"+hAhNwlMFe\":\"AI agents\",\"+iTX/h/IcT\":\"Custom instructions that Claude follows in conversations across your organization.\",\"+jQhEzhXMV\":\"Checking last quarter’s board deck for the list\",\"+m96NS3CJR\":\"$14\",\"+mv46Ajpn5\":\"Per month\",\"+okyOR6KuS\":\"{count} {noun}\",\"+ol/wJP1Un\":\"Build the dashboard, one chart per metric\",\"+rPro49cx4\":\"Contact sales\",\"+uZMvaQTeS\":\"Watch on demand\",\"+vGpRUpAum\":\"Q2 just closed — that one, o