new possibilities for long-running agents—processing entire codebases, analyzing hundreds of documents, or maintaining extensive tool interaction histories. Context management builds on this foundation, ensuring agents can leverage this expanded capacity efficiently while still handling workflows that extend beyond any fixed limit. Use cases include:\"]}]\n4e:[\"$\",\"ul\",\"c18ff96816d8-parent\",{\"className\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"c18ff96816d8\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"d8194b55bed1\",{\"children\":[\"Coding:\"]}],\" Context editing clears old file reads and test results while memory preserves debugging insights and architectural decisions, enabling agents to work on large codebases without losing progress.\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"d5384de37bc0\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"a098c3ea0d10\",{\"children\":[\"Research: \"]}],\"Memory stores key findings while context editing removes old search results, building knowledge bases that improve performance over time.\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"32b8ddabe5bb\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"5f989f07a836\",{\"children\":[\"Data processing: \"]}],\"Agents store intermediate results in memory while context editing clears raw data, handling workflows that would otherwise exceed token limits.\"]}]]}]\n4f:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"2d873255a018\",{\"className\":\"$undefined\",\"id\":\"performance-improvements-with-context-management\",\"children\":[\"Performance improvements with context management\"]}]\n50:[\"$\",\"p\",\"389c3d3736e5\",{\"className\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[\"On an internal evaluation set for agentic search, we tested how context management improves agent performance on complex, multi-step tasks. The results demonstrate significant gains: combining the memory tool with context editing improved performance by 39% over baseline. Context editing alone delivered a 29% improvement.\"]}]\n51:[\"$\",\"p\",\"741933a5c221\",{\"className\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[\"In a 100-turn web search evaluation, context editing enabled agents to complete workflows that would otherwise fail due to context exhaustion—while reducing token consumption by 84%.\"]}]\n52:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"f66179dc2655\",{\"className\":\"$undefined\",\"id\":\"getting-started\",\"children\":[\"Getting started\"]}]\n53:[\"$\",\"p\",\"5012706c0cc3\",{\"className\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[\"These capabilities are available today in public beta on the Claude Developer Platform, natively and in Amazon Bedrock and Google Cloud’s Vertex AI. Explore the documentation for \",[\"$\",\"a\",\"f5448f01acb9\",{\"href\":\"https://docs.claude.com/en/docs/build-with-claude/context-editing\",\"target\":\"$undefined\",\"rel\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[[\"context editing\"],\"$undefined\"]}],\" and the \",[\"$\",\"a\",\"81d88ac8bb60\",{\"href\":\"https://docs.claude.com/en/docs/agents-and-tools/tool-use/memory-tool\",\"target\":\"$undefined\",\"rel\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[[\"memory tool\"],\"$undefined\"]}],\", or visit our \",[\"$\",\"a\",\"4339bc08ed56\",{\"href\":\"https://platform.claude.com/cookbook/tool-use-memory-cookbook\",\"target\":\"$undefined\",\"rel\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[[\"cookbook\"],\"$undefined\"]}],\" to learn more.\"]}]\n54:[\"$\",\"p\",\"5fc1de046f87\",{\"className\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"em\",\"b85509c0faea\",{\"chi"])</script><script nonce="usfoTvutOV5VRcTEPvHMSQ==">self.__next_f.push([1,"ldren\":[\"Anthropic is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by CATAN GmbH or CATAN Studio. The CATAN trademark and game are the property of CATAN GmbH.\"]}]]}]\n55:[null,null,false,\"$undefined\"]\n61:T63cc,\u003csvg width=\"1000\" height=\"1000\" viewBox=\"0 0 1000 1000\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"\u003e\n\u003cpath d=\"M575.309 518.941C580.359 518.641 585.42 518.321 590.46 518.461C599.09 518.701 607.71 519.301 616.33 519.741C621.65 520.051 627.04 520.312 632.88 520.602C631.07 527.191 631.35 533.452 632.15 539.892C632.81 545.291